26	/**
27	 * Jackson customization for owner payloads.
28	 * <p>
29	 * {@code sharesHousehold} is a write-only hint accepted only when creating an owner (see the
30	 * {@code OwnerFields} schema); it is never stored, so it has nothing to return. The generated
31	 * {@link OwnerDto} nevertheless inherits the property from the shared schema, so a mix-in marks
32	 * it {@link JsonProperty.Access#WRITE_ONLY} to keep it out of owner responses.
