24	/**
25	 * Computes the canonical key that identifies an owner's household, namely the pair of last
26	 * name and address. Both fields are compared case-insensitively and with runs of whitespace
27	 * collapsed to a single space, so cosmetic differences do not split a household. Two owners
28	 * belong to the same household exactly when their keys are equal.
29	 */
